<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Australia beat China 6-2 (halftime 3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Jenny Morris 3, 28, Kelly Free 34, 49,</p>
<p>58, Katrina Powell 68</p>
<p>China - Yu Shuzhen 33, Liu Ying 43.</p>
</text>
